# Self-Destruct on Memnite with Bot2 as the other target. In response Bot1 Shocks its own Memnite, so the creature (the source) is an
# illegal target on resolution and deals no damage at all: Bot2 stays at 20 even though Bot2 is still a legal target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Memnite
Self-Destruct
Shock
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Self-Destruct.Cast
Bot1.Target(Memnite)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Shock.Cast(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Self-Destruct; Memnite; Shock; Black Lotus
